  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "These photos take up 30GB of space because they're all stored as PNGs.\nCan we PLEASE get OPTIONAL automatic conversion to JPEG to save disk space as well as a camera which saves images in the correct orientation so that half of the 15K pictures I'll take this year don't have to be rotated by hand?\nAlso please do something with the camera interface to make the buttons easier to press, and make it more difficult to accidentally click the panorama button as the game freezes up for 30 seconds every time I hit that.",
